    "type": 0,
    "content": "Note: look below for a faster method that only works on steam/web!\n\nYou’ll need some setup. You’ll need to be on your DK and have lots of googly eyes.\nStep 1: fill up your inventory with stacks of 1 googly eyes.\nStep 2: stand over the hourglass and click your “knight diciple” ability.\nStep 3: Drop a googly eyes.\nStep 4: when the background turns day again, drop another googly eyes.\n\nWhen the ability runs out, use it again, obviously. Repeat until all your eyes are used up!",
